msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>おでかけチケット<CLT><CLT 23>を８枚獲得した。<CLT>
msgctxt "0078 | NARRATION"
msgid "<CLT 3><CLT><CLT 23>You received 8<CLT> <CLT 3>Trip Tickets<CLT><CLT 23>.<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. これが…萌え？
msgctxt "0079 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "This is...moe?"
msgstr ""

#. 確かに見た目はかわいいけどさぁ…
msgctxt "0080 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "It's got a certain cuteness, I guess. But..."
msgstr ""

#. でもなんかダメ！
#. これじゃない感がひどい！
msgctxt "0081 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "But something about it is off! It's wrong!"
msgstr ""

#. という訳で、やり直し！！
msgctxt "0082 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "So DO IT OVER!"
msgstr ""

