"your assignment, so..."
msgstr ""

#. 今回もチケットをあげるよ！
msgctxt "0091 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "...I guess I'll give you some more tickets!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>おでかけチケット<CLT><CLT 23>を８枚獲得した。<CLT>
msgctxt "0092 | NARRATION"
msgid "<CLT 3><CLT><CLT 23>You received 8<CLT> <CLT 3>Trip Tickets<CLT><CLT 23>.<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 何これ？
#. 見た目はまったく同じじゃない。
msgctxt "0093 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Huh? This thing looks just like me."
msgstr ""

#. ん？　背中に何か…
msgctxt "0094 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Wait...what's this on the back?"
msgstr ""

#. チャック？
#. しかもなんか、中から音が聞こえるんだけど…
msgctxt "0095 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"A zipper? And...is that a voice I hear coming\n"
"from inside?"
msgstr ""

#. たすけて…
#. だれか…たすけて…
msgctxt "0096 | NO NAME"
msgid "Help me... Someone...help me..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今、何か、聞こえてはいけない感じの声が…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0097 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I think I just heard something I don't think I wanted\n"
"to hear...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0098 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 確認するけど、オマエラ、全員そろってるよね？
#. そろってるね？
msgctxt "0099 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Listen, is everyone present and accounted for?\n"
"Nobody missing? Okay, just making sure..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0100 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. えー、今のは聞かなかった事にします！
msgctxt "0101 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "I guess I'll just pretend I didn't hear anything!"
msgstr ""

#. それで、あえて聞くけどさ…
#. これのどの辺がアダルトなのかな？
msgctxt "0102 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Now, I'm almost afraid to ask, but...what exactly\n"
"makes this \"adult\"?"
msgstr ""

#. あ、そっかぁ！
#. なんだか秘密があると大人っぽいって事なんだね！
msgctxt "0103 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Wait, no, I know! You were thinking it's kind of\n"
"adultish to have secrets, right?"
msgstr ""

#. どこの小学生の発想だよッ！
#. オマエラは一応、高校生でしょ！？
msgctxt "0104 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"That's totally an elementary school way of thinking!\n"
"Aren't you guys all high schoolers!?"
msgstr ""

#. という訳で、やり直し！！
msgctxt "0105 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "So DO IT OVER!"
msgstr ""

#. また失敗だけど、作るって目標は
#. ちゃんと達成してたし…
msgctxt "0106 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"It's a total failure, but you did technically finish\n"
"your assignment, so..."
msgstr ""

#. 今回もチケットをあげるよ！
msgctxt "0107 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "...I guess I'll give you some more tickets!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>おでかけチケット<CLT><CLT 23>を８枚獲得した。<CLT>
msgctxt "0108 | NARRATION"
msgid "<CLT 3><CLT><CLT 23>You received 8<CLT> <CLT 3>Trip Tickets<CLT><CLT 23>.<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. これ…見るからに気持ち悪いよね？
#. 賢さの欠片も感じられないよね…？
msgctxt "0109 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"This thing is—I mean, you *know* it's disgusting,\n"
"right? I don't feel even a speck of wisdom..."
msgstr ""

#. どうしてこうなるんだよッ！！
msgctxt "0110 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "How'd it end up like this!?"
msgstr ""

#. たくさんの事を同時にこなせるように
#. 首を３つ、つけてみたんだけど…
msgctxt "0111 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"We decided to put three heads on it so it could,\n"
"you know, like...multitask."
msgstr ""

#. その発想が残念すぎる…！
msgctxt "0112 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "What a stupid idea!"
msgstr ""

#. むしろボクをバカにしてるレベルだよね？
msgctxt "0113 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "I feel like you're just making fun of me now..."
msgstr ""

#. でも、上手くいくかもしれないし…
msgctxt "0114 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But I think it could turn out okay. I mean, maybe...?"
msgstr ""

#. ボクが先にやるんだって！
msgctxt "0115 | MONOKUMA BACKUP (R)"
msgid "Lemme go first!"
msgstr ""

#. ボクの言う事を聞いておけば問題ないの！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0116 | MONOKUMA BACKUP (L)"
msgid ""
"No! Everyone do what I say!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あー、やる気ないっすわー…
#. 食って寝て遊んでたい…
msgctxt "0117 | MONOKUMA BACKUP (M)"
msgid ""
"Ahh, I'm feeling so lazy! I just want to eat, sleep,\n"
"and play video games!"
msgstr ""

#. ほら、案の定だよ！
#. しかも１つは根本的に駄目な発言してるし！
msgctxt "0118 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "I knew it! They're all a bunch of idiots!"
msgstr ""

#. やり直しです！！
msgctxt "0119 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Do it again!"
msgstr ""

#. また失敗だけど、作るって目標は
#. ちゃんと達成してたし…
msgctxt "0120 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"It's a total failure, but you did technically finish\n"
"your assignment, so..."
msgstr ""

#. 今回もチケットをあげるよ！
msgctxt "0121 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "...I guess I'll give you some more tickets!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>おでかけチケット<CLT><CLT 23>を９枚獲得した。<CLT>
msgctxt "0122 | NARRATION"
msgid "<CLT 3><CLT><CLT 23>You received 9<CLT> <CLT 3>Trip Tickets<CLT><CLT 23>.<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. へえ、キャノンをつけてみたんだね！
msgctxt "0123 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Whoa, a fully functional chest cannon!?\n"
"Now THIS is what I'm talking about!"
msgstr ""

#. うんうん！
#. 大艦巨砲主義はやっぱり男のロマンですよ！
msgctxt "0124 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Yeah! Hell yeah! It's every man's dream to have a\n"
"total badass warmachine at his disposal!"
msgstr ""

#. オマエラもわかってるじゃない！
msgctxt "0125 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "You guys totally get me!"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、さっそく試しに撃ってみましょーう！
msgctxt "0126 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Alright, let's open fire!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>そして、モノクマがスイッチを押した瞬間…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0127 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>The instant Monokuma pulled the trigger...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>派手な音と共に、キャノンが発射されて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0128 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>...there was a flash of light, and the cannon let\n"
"loose.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あああああああっ！？
msgctxt "0129 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Uwaaaaaaahhh!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>同時に、スペア本体も
#. 反動で後ろに吹っ飛んでいってしまった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0130 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>At the same time, the backup's body got blown back by\n"
"the force of it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …オマエラ！
msgctxt "0131 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Dammit, you guys!"
msgstr ""

#. ボクにこんな寒いコントを
#. やらせる為にこれを作ったのかな…？
msgctxt "0132 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"You just built this thing for this stupid comedy\n"
"routine, didn't you!?"
msgstr ""

#. はい、やり直しだよ！
msgctxt "0133 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Well you know what? DO IT OVER!"
msgstr ""

#. また失敗だけど、作るって目標は
#. ちゃんと達成してたし…
msgctxt "0134 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"It's a total failure, but you did technically finish\n"
"your assignment, so..."
msgstr ""

#. 今回もチケットをあげるよ！
msgctxt "0135 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "...I guess I'll give you some more tickets!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>おでかけチケット<CLT><CLT 23>を９枚獲得した。<CLT>
msgctxt "0136 | NARRATION"
msgid "<CLT 3><CLT><CLT 23>You received 9<CLT> <CLT 3>Trip Tickets<CLT><CLT 23>.<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …ん？
#. なにこれ？
msgctxt "0137 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "What the...?"
msgstr "Cái quái...?"

#. もはやモノクマじゃないんですけど…
msgctxt "0138 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "It's not even a Monokuma anymore."
msgstr ""

#. ………
#. もういいや…
msgctxt "0139 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Fine, whatever..."
msgstr ""

#. とりあえず出来上がったってことで
#. ご褒美はあげるよ…
msgctxt "0140 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"You finished it, so I guess I'll give you a reward or\n"
"whatever."
msgstr ""

#. でももう５０日経っちゃうよ…
msgctxt "0141 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "But it's already been 50 days, ya know."
msgstr ""

#. このやり方でやっててもダメみたいだし、
#. 他のやり方を考えることにしましょう。
msgctxt "0142 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"This whole thing seems totally pointless. Maybe I\n"
"should figure out another approach..."
msgstr ""

#. …というわけで、
#. 最終日まで適当に過ごしといてください！
msgctxt "0143 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Go ahead and waste your time however you want till\n"
"we're all done!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>おでかけチケット<CLT><CLT 23>を４枚獲得した。<CLT>
msgctxt "0144 | NARRATION"
msgid "<CLT 3><CLT><CLT 23>You received 4<CLT> <CLT 3>Trip Tickets<CLT><CLT 23>.<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 結構、頑張ってたみたいだし…
msgctxt "0145 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "It seems like you've been working really hard."
msgstr ""

#. 御褒美にこれもあげちゃいましょーう！
msgctxt "0146 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"And to reward you for all that effort, let me give\n"
"you...this!"
msgstr ""

#. それの使い方は…
msgctxt "0147 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Now, to use that..."
msgstr ""

#. ま、言わなくてもわかってるよね～！
msgctxt "0148 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Well, you don't need me to tell you, right!?"
msgstr ""

#. よくわかんねーけど
#. まぁ、頑張ってたんじゃねーの？
msgctxt "0149 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Hmm... I'm not too sure about the final product, but\n"
"it looks like everyone gave it the old college try."
msgstr ""

#. だから、御褒美に
#. これもあげちゃいましょーう…みたいな？
msgctxt "0150 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "So here's a mediocre reward for your mediocre effort!"
msgstr ""

#. それの使い方はオマエ次第。
#. ドントシンク、フィールだ！
msgctxt "0151 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"How you decide to use them is up to you. Don't think\n"
"about it, just feel it!"
msgstr ""

